  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed dormer extensions, by way of their size, bulk, and siting, would represent an incongruous addition that would cause harm to the host property, wider streetscene and West Putney Conservation Area. The proposal is therefore deemed contrary to LP1 and LP3 of the Local Plan. ",
